are important to bring up in those situations.

00:06:36.199 --> 00:06:41.740
First of all, in many of these mass shooting
scenarios, you only have to think it through

00:06:41.740 --> 00:06:44.569
to realize additional guns would accomplish
nothing.

00:06:44.569 --> 00:06:51.210
For example, the Aurora movie theater shooting
in Colorado years ago, a shooting in a dark

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:52.540
movie theater.

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:59.259
It doesn't take much of an imagination to
understand how adding more guns in a dark

00:06:59.259 --> 00:07:06.449
room so that there's more shooting maybe at
the real shooter or maybe not, and then potentially

00:07:06.449 --> 00:07:07.449
causing.

00:07:07.449 --> 00:07:10.889
Imagine that you're the third guy with a gun
and you come in and you just see two people

00:07:10.889 --> 00:07:12.610
shooting at each other.

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:15.860
How do you know which is the bad guy with
the gun and which is the good guy with it's

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:17.229
absolute and total chaos?

00:07:17.229 --> 00:07:18.229
That's number one.

00:07:18.229 --> 00:07:25.310
Number two, there are numerous examples, numerous
examples of mass shootings where we later

00:07:25.310 --> 00:07:32.100
found out there were other people with firearms
there and they didn't act because of exactly

00:07:32.100 --> 00:07:33.100
what I'm saying.

00:07:33.100 --> 00:07:34.250
It was so chaotic.

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:38.789
These things happened so quickly that it didn't
actually make a difference.

00:07:38.789 --> 00:07:44.389
Now, the counterpoint is you occasionally
hear about a gun actually used defensively

00:07:44.389 --> 00:07:46.110
to stop a situation.

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:48.830
And that's absolutely and totally fine.

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:54.939
But the bigger, more common, more prevalent
scenario is that more guns actually add more

00:07:54.939 --> 00:07:55.939
chaos.

00:07:55.939 --> 00:08:01.280
And overall, limiting the number of guns that
are floating around would have a much stronger

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:07.129
impact on reducing gun crime and gun mortality
than simply adding more guns to situation.

